* 
* 
* %Parameters
* lambda0: [unit] [AA]  The mean value of  incoming wavelegths (Gaussian distribution)
* dlambda: [unit] [AA] Gaussian sigma of incoming wavelength distribution
* coll: [unit] [arcmin] horizontal collimation
* container: [unit] [1] When >0 a 2mm thick Al pressed powder can is inserted around the sample
* sample: [unit] [1] 0=Ni, 1=Fe, 2=SiO2, 3=C_diamond, otherwise empty
* 
